atterns in data.\n*   **AI needs data to learn.** The more data, the better it performs.\n*   **AI is only as good as the data it\'s trained on.** If you train it on biased data, it will be biased.\n*   **AI can\'t "think" like humans.** It doesn\'t have feelings or consciousness. It\'s just really good at doing specific tasks.\n\n**In short, AI is a computer program that can learn from data to perform tasks that usually require human intelligence.** It\'s used in all sorts of things these days, from recommending movies to diagnosing diseases.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, name='llm_expert', id='run--42709850-b115-4e28-aca7-bc403498ee78-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 90, 'output_tokens': 418, 'total_tokens': 508, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), AIMessage(content='The query "What is ai in flnaolgna" appears to be a question about the application of AI in a specific domain, although the domain "flnaolgna" is not immediately recognizable. It\'s possible this is a typo or a niche term. Since the query has a clear structure (question about AI in something), I will proceed without using the human_feedback tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'prompt_feedback': {'block_reason': 0, 'safety_ratings': []}, 'finish_reason': 'STOP', 'model_name': 'gemini-2.0-flash', 'safety_ratings': []}, id='run--1dce924e-1c9c-444c-acbb-bd2acb747e0b-0', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 327, 'output_tokens': 80, 'total_tokens': 407, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 0}}), AIMessage(content='I\'m sorry, but "flnaolgna" doesn\'t seem to be a recognized term or acronym in any common field. It\'s possible there\'s a typo in the word, or it might refer to a very specific or internal concept within a particular organization or project that I don\'t have access to.\n\nTo help me answer your question, could you pleas